# components/ui hierarchy

When creating or moving files under `**/components/ui/**`:

- Load `skills/code/web/ui/SKILL.md` and **`references/components-ui-hierarchy.md`** before adding folders or components.
- Cross-feature primitives → `common/`; domain shared blocks → `<domain>/common/`; viewport layout → `<domain>/mobile/` or `<domain>/desktop/` only.
- Do not put viewport-specific layout in `common/`; do not duplicate base logic across variants.
- Thin selectors at domain root; compose from `common/`. See `references/responsive-variants.md` for composition rules.
- Motion, overlays, pickers → `code/web/ux` (variant paths also match `mobile-ux.mdc` / `desktop-ux.mdc`).
